{
  "version": 2,
  "front_door": "written-as-spoken",
  "notes": "Machine-readable routing graph for the Written as Spoken suite. scripts/route.mjs classifies a request against it, scripts/lint.mjs reads feedback.lint to attach a repair owner to every finding, and scripts/check-links.mjs fails the build when any node, path or edge is broken. Signals are matched after Arabic normalisation (see route.mjs). Ties are broken by priority: intents that name an output format (2) beat intents that name a topic (1).",
